        solution: `Étape 1 : $\\mathcal{V} = \\frac{1}{3} \\times ${c}^2 \\times ${H} = ${f(V)}\\text{ cm}^3$.\nÉtape 2 : $k = \\frac{${f(hp)}}{${H}} = ${kk === 0.5 ? '0{,}5' : kk < 0.5 ? '\\frac{1}{3}' : '\\frac{2}{3}'}$.\nÉtape 3 : $\\mathcal{V}' = k^3 \\times \\mathcal{V} = ${kk === 0.5 ? '0{,}125' : kk < 0.5 ? '\\frac{1}{27}' : '\\frac{8}{27}'} \\times ${f(V)} ${Math.abs(v - +v.toFixed(1)) < 1e-9 ? '=' : '\\approx'} ${f(+v.toFixed(1))}$.\nLa petite pyramide a un volume ${Math.abs(v - +v.toFixed(1)) < 1e-9 ? 'de' : "d'environ"} $${f(+v.toFixed(1))}\\text{ cm}^3$.`,
        _v: { k: 'G5.petitePyr', c, H, kk }
