          solution: `**Étape 1** : la parenthèse vaut $${res} \\div ${a} = ${x + b}$.\n**Étape 2** : $\\square + ${b} = ${x + b}$, donc $\\square = ${x + b} - ${b} = ${x}$.\n**Vérification** : $${a} \\times (${x} + ${b}) = ${a} \\times ${x + b} = ${res}$.`,
