        solution: `**Étape 1** : $${b} \\times (\\square - ${c}) = ${res} - ${a} = ${res - a}$.\n**Étape 2** : $\\square - ${c} = ${res - a} \\div ${b} = ${x - c}$.\n**Étape 3** : $\\square = ${x - c} + ${c} = ${x}$.\n**Vérification** : $${a} + ${b} \\times (${x} - ${c}) = ${a} + ${b} \\times ${x - c} = ${res}$.`,
